I have standardised the keys for my IoT devices so they are easier to program! I think this is really smart, since the devices are simple I decided to use DES as the encryption algorithm.

{ "namespace": "IOTDEV", "message": "74eb40cf03b84d0bc4cd2c6e0fe97fb4e70546d3e09c530d35b344e530351bac" }

"namespace": "IOTDEV" = hint naar de key
"DES" = verouderd blokcijfer met keylength 56 bits. werkt met blokken
        van 8 bytes en DES-key is altijd exact 8 bytes (64 bits)

De JSON: {"namespace": "IOTDEV", "message": "74eb40cf03..."}.
De message is waarschijnlijk de hexadecimale weergave van de versleutelde data.